  (MIT, see packages/play-operate/LICENSE and README-FORK.md)
- packages/appstore-operate — fork of github.com/devinwang/app-store-connect-mcp
  (MIT, see packages/appstore-operate/LICENSE and README-FORK.md)
- packages/play-analytics — fork of github.com/desunit/google-play-analytics-mcp
  (MIT, see packages/play-analytics/LICENSE and README-FORK.md)

Design ideas grafted (not copied code) from:
- OrellBuehler/play-console-mcp and OrellBuehler/testflight-mcp (MIT)
- zelentsov-dev/asc-mcp (MIT) — --workers, --read-only, exact confirmation
- antoniolg/play-store-mcp (MIT, archived) — deploy_app one-shot idea (TODO, not yet implemented)
- fil-technology/appstore-api-mcp (MIT) — dry-run diff / ASO audit ideas (TODO, not yet implemented)
